{title: In the Name of Jesus}
{x_theme: name-of-jesus, victory}
{x_source: docx:1. Incomplete/In the name of Jesus.docx}

{comment: Chorus}
In the name of Jesus, In the name of Jesus
We have the victory
In the name of Jesus, In the name of Jesus
Demon’s will have to flee
Tell me who can stand before us
When we call on His great name
Jesus, Jesus, precious Jesus
We have the victory
